        "GIENDINGH MBOUJ BIENQ RIENGZ DIUZ ROEN SEVEICUJYI MIZ CUNGGUEK DAEGSAEK BYAIJ BAENAJ VIH CIENZMIENH HWNQBAENZ AEN BIENGZ SIUJGANGH BAE BUEKGUH",
        "Bwngz Dwzvaiz (1898 nienz 10 nyied 24 hauh - 1974 nienz 11 nyied 29 hauh) dwg aen yienzsoi Cunghgoz Yinzminz Gaijfangginh.",
        "Marshall Ginzdauj (Vah Yinghgoz: Marshall Islands |Vah Marshallese: Ṃajeḷ) dwg aen guekgya youq Daihyangzcouh. Saudu dwg Majuro. Kiez hanx dwg 1,123 ginzdauj.",
        "Gingcig (驚蟄) dwg aen cietheiq daihsam, youq hawxsij baihlaeng, youq cinfaen baihnaj.",
