        "Aeu baengh song cik fwngz, gwn daenj yienghyiengh miz. 要靠两只手，吃穿样样有。 Working with both hands, you get food and clothes.",
        "Bongz baenz ceiz saz. 像火煨糍粑一样胀。 He grows bigger like a ciba that is burning in the fire.",
        "Gou maij ndangseuq ha hoeng deng cainanh, haet bae hwnjcauz haemh deng yiemz.",
        "Nyaenq Cinggangh, lij caengz lumz; Haemz lwgminz, seizlawz liux?",
        "Ciuhvunzndaenggon caenh riuangq，gaej cajcenj hoengq ciuq ronghndwen.",
        "Mwngz gaej laeg gangj gou song fwngz byouq byangq byangq",
        "Gaeuq Cau dawz cuiz banq, Hanzdanh cungj saetsing.",
        "4 nyied 1 hauh, Dangjcunghyangh fatok《Aen Dunghcih Gvendaengz Doiq Baez Roek Cungh Daengxhoih Gaiq Cibgouj Cungdenj Yenzgiu Aen Vwndiz Cienzmienh Cungjgez Gij Cwngzciu Hungnaek Caeuq Gingniemh Lizsij Dangj Raeuz Cam’aeu Yigen》, youq ndaw Dangj rog Dangj itdingh fanveiz cam’aeu yigen.",
        "Sangdi yiengq ndaw Yozswz bauj yienh okdaeuj, naeuz de nyi Majliya daiq miz gij mizndang haenx dwg daj Sangdi daeuj. Boux sij de heuhguh Yozswz（若瑟） aeu ndeindei ciuqgoq Majliya caeuq Swngswnghvuz Yezsuh.",
        "Bozsw aenvih youq ndaw fangzhwnzloq deng saenzbaed cijsi, gaej baema raen Hihlizvangz, couh daj lingh aen roen dauqma bonjdieg lo.",
        "Cienzhoih giengzdiuh, youq hingzseiq moq baihlaj gyagiengz caeuq gveihfan gij cwngci swnghhoz ndaw dangj, cungdenj dwg gak gaep lingjdauj gihgvanh caeuq lingjdauj ganbu, gvanhgen dwg gauhgiz ganbu daegbied dwg doengh boux gapbaenz Cunghyangh Veijyenzvei、 Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz、Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz Cangzvu Veijyenzvei haenx. Gauhgiz ganbu daegbied dwg doengh boux gapbaenz caengz cunghyangh lingjdauj haenx itdingh aeu caenndang guh yienghndei, mozfan ciuqsouj dangjcangh dangjgveih, yiemzsouj gij cwngci gijliz caeuq cwngci gvigawj aen dangj, genhciz mbouj lumz gij simnyienh codaeuz、laebdaeb baenaj, genhciz daiqdaeuz guh yienghndei、aeu baihgwnz daiqdoengh baihlaj, vih daengx dangj daengx sevei guh ok sifan.",
        "Cienzhoih saemjlwnh caemhcaiq doenggvaq le Cunghgung Cunghyangh Gijliz Genjcaz Veijyenvei aen saemjcaz baugau gvendaengz gij vwndiz Vangz Minz、 Lij Sizvwnz famh gijliz youqgaenj, saemjlwnh caemhcaiq doenggvaq le Cunghgung Cunghyangh Ginhsw Veijyenzvei aen saemjcaz baugau gvendaengz gij vwndiz Fan Cangzmi、 Niuz Cicungh famh gijliz youqgaenj, nyinhdingh aen cujfwnh hawj Vangz Minz、 Lij Sizvwnz、 Fan Cangzmi、 Niuz Cicungh haicawz dangjciz Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz gaxgonq guh’ok haenx.",
        "Daengx dangj itdingh aeu genhciz dawz ginghci gensez guh cungsim di he hix mbouj doenghngauz, dinghsim comzrengz ca’ndei fazcanj aen yinvu ceiq youqgaenj dangj raeuz gaemgienz hwngguek neix, genhciz aen fazcanj swhsiengj aeu yinzminz guh cungsim, doicaenh “haj yiengh gyoebbaenz aen cingjdaej ndeu” cungjdaej baijbouh caeuq hezdiuz doicaenh “seiq aen cienzmienh” canloz baijbouh, genhciz aen fazcanj leixniemh cauhmoq、 hezdiuz、 loegsaek、 hailangh、 caezyiengj, roengzrengz daezsang fazcanj cizlieng caeuq yauyiz, mboujduenh daezsang yinzminz swnghhoz suijbingz, vih saedyienh “song aen bak bi” fwndou muzbyauh、 saedyienh aen loqsiengj Cungguek--Cunghvaz Minzcuz fukhwng hungmbwk dwk roengz vuzciz giekdaej maenhsaed.",
        "Cwngci gijliz dwg ndaw dangj gij gijliz ceiq gaenbonj、 ceiq youqgaenj de, eiqsouj cwngci gijliz dwg gij giekdaej eiqsouj cienzbouh gijliz dangj raeuz. Daengx dangj daegbied dwg gauhgiz ganbu itdingh aeu yiemzgek eiqsouj cwngci gijliz caeuq cwngci gvigawj dangj raeuz. Dangjyenz mbouj cinj cienzboq gij vah boihfamh lijlun caeuq lohsienq fuengcim cwngcwz dangj raeuz, mbouj cinj goenghai gangj gij vah boihfamh dangj cunghyangh gietdingh, mbouj cinj laeuh gij mimiz dangj caeuq guekgya okbae, mbouj cinj camgya gij cujciz mbouj habfap caeuq gij hozdung mbouj habfap, mbouj cinj biencaux、 cienzboq cwngci yauzyenz caeuq gangj gij vah coujva dangj caeuq guekgya hingzsieng. Dangjyenz mbouj cinj gauj funghgen maezsaenq, mbouj cinj saenqngiengx cunghgyau, mbouj cinj camgya sezgyau, mbouj cinj yungzhawj caeuq cihciz cunghgyau gizdonh seiqlig、 minzcuz faenmbek seiqlig、 bauliz gungjbu seiqlig caeuq doenghgij hozdung de.",
        "Ndaw dangj minzcuj dwg diuzmingh aen dangj raeuz, dwg gij cwngci swnghhoz ndaw dangj cizgiz gengangh aen giekdaej youqgaenj de. Aeu genhciz caeuq guhcaez ndaw dangj minzcuj gak hangh cidu, daezsang gij caetliengh ndaw dangj minzcuj, ndaw dangj gezcwz、 caephengz、 gamduk daengj gunghcoz itdingh aeu caephengz gij minzcuj yenzcwz caeuq cwngzsi dangjcangh dangjgveih doekdingh haenx, aen dangj cujciz lawz caeuq boux vunz lawz, cungj mbouj ndaej gaemhnaenx gij minzcuj ndaw dangj, buqvaih gij minzcuj ndaw dangj.",
        "Daengxcungq dangjyenz、 ganbu daegbied dwg gauhgiz ganbu itdingh aeu demgiengz gij eiqsik aen dangj, seizseiz geiqmaenh swhgeij aen ndangfaenh daih’it dwg dangjyenz. Mboujlwnh boux dangjyenz lawz cungj mbouj ndaej youzliz youq baihrog dangj cujciz, engqgya mbouj ndaej ak gvaq dangj cujciz bae. Moix boux dangjyenz mboujlwnh cizvu sang daemq, cungj aeu camgya gij cujciz swnghhoz aen dangj. Dangj cujciz aeu yiemzgek caephengz cujciz swnghhoz cidu, saedbauj gij cujciz swnghhoz aen dangj raeuz ciengzseiz、 nyinhcaen、 yiemzsuk.",
        "Cauhguh aen vanzging ndaw dangj minzcuj gamduk, hawj diuz miengloh minzcuj gamduk ndaw dangj doengrat. Gak gaep dangj cujciz caeuq daengxcungq dangjyenz aeu demgiengz gamduk eiqsik, gawq hengzguh gamduk cwzyin, youh ciepsouh gak fuengmienh gamduk.",
        "Gyagiengz caeuq gveihfan ndaw dangj cwngci swnghhoz, aeu daj Cunghyangh Veijyenzvei、 Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz、 Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz Cangzvu Veijyenzvei guhhwnj. Gauhgiz ganbu aeu cingsingj nyinhrox gangjvei swhgeij doiq dangj caeuq guekgya miz maz cung’yausing daegbied, cizvei yied sang yied aeu gagrox ciuq gij biucinj aen dangj daezok de yiemzgek iugouz swhgeij, yied aeu guh daengz dangjsing giengiengz、 dangjgij yiemzmingz, guh daengz doiq dangj itcig cungsim、 ciengzlwenx mbouj fanj dangj. Ceiqdingh aen hengzguh yigen gvendaengz gauhgiz ganbu baenzlawz gvancez lozsiz aen cunjcwz neix, cijdauj caeuq dukcoi gauhgiz ganbu youq ciuqsouj nem caephengz aen cunjcwz ndaw dangj cwngci swnghhoz fuengmienh guh yienghndei.",
        "Daih 6 diuz Gij cungdenj doiqsiengq ndaw dangj gamduk dwg dangj raeuz lingjdauj gihgvanh caeuq lingjdauj ganbu daegbied dwg cujyau lingjdauj ganbu.",
        "Gaepgwnz dangj cujciz daegbied dwg boux cujyau fucwz de, doiq boux cujyau fucwz gaeplaj dangj cujciz wngdang bingzseiz lai causim di, lai daezsingj di, fatyienh vwndiz gibseiz niujcingq. Boux vunz gapbaenz lingjdauj banhswj de fatyienh banhswj boux cujyau fucwz de miz vwndiz, wngdang gibseiz yiengq de daezok, mwh miz bizyau de ndaej cigsoh bauq naeuz gaepgwnz dangj cujciz rox.",
        "Daih 28 diuz Aen gigenjcuj gijveij baijcap de doiq aen gihgvanh mbaibaij de fucwz, gyagiengz gamduk lingjdauj banhswj caeuq boux cwngzyenz aen danhvei deng gamduk、 gizyawz lingjdauj ganbu, fatyienh vwndiz wngdang gibseiz bauq naeuz aen gihgvanh mbaibaij de caeuq gij dangj cujciz aen danhvei deng gamduk de rox, nyinhcaen fucwz diucaz cawqceq, doiq gij aeu gyaepdawz cwzyin de daezok genyi.",
        "（3）Camgya gij hozdung bingzgangj lingjdauj ganbu dangj cujciz mbeguh de, gamj bungq mauzdun vwndiz、 ceijok loengcawq, doiq gij hengzdoengh gangjvah loekloeng de gamj bae baebuek、 gamj bae doucwngh；",
        "Bineix 2 nyied, Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz gietdingh, dangj raeuz Cibbet Gaiq Roek Cung Cienzhoih ciendaez yenzgiu aen vwndiz cienzmienh coengzyiemz ceih dangj, ceiqdingh doengh aen cunjcwz gvendaengz laj hingzseiq moq ndaw dangj cwngci swnghhoz, coihdingh 《Cungguek Gungcanjdangj Ndaw Dangj Gamduk Diuzlaeh（Sawqhengz）》, laebbaenz aen cuj dajgauj vwnzgen, youz gou dang cujcangj, Liuz Yinzsanh、Vangz Gizsanh dungzci dang fucujcangj, mizgven bouhmonz caeuq deihfueng fucwz dungzci camgya, youz Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz Cangzveijvei lingjdauj bae guh hong dajgauj. ",
        "Youq ndaw 8 ndwen seizgan, aen cuj dajgauj vwnzgen guh ciendaez diuyenz, gvangqlangh cam’aeu yigen caeuq genyi, fanfuk yaenglwnh coihgaij. Ndaw mboengq seizgan neix, Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz Cangzveijvei ciuhai 3 baez hoih、 Cunghyangh Cwngcigiz ciuhai 2 baez hoih faenbied saemjlwnh vwnzgengauj. 8 nyied co, aen vwnzgengauj cam’aeu yigen neix fatroengz aen gvaengh daegdingh ndaw dangj bae cam’aeu yigen, baudaengz cam’aeu gij yigen ndaw dangj bouhfaenh dungzci geq, lij cienmonz dingqaeu le gij yigen bouxfucwz gak aen minzcuj dangjbai cunghyangh、 Daengx Guek Gunghsanghlenz caeuq gij vunz mizmingz mbouj camgya dangjbai de.",
        "Daih 6 cieng daengz daih 8 cieng gapbaenz daihsam bouhfaenh, baij ok le 11 diuz, faenbied doiq ndaw dangj gamduk caeuq baihrog gamduk dox giethab、 cingjgaij caeuq baujcang、 gij gveihcwz bengxgya de daengj guh ok gvidingh. Diuzlaeh mbouj guh ok gij gvidingh hawjgienz cunghyangh buveij caeuq deihfueng dangjveij ceiqdingh gij gveihcwz ciengzsaeq hengzguh de, daejyienh daengx dangj bietdingh aeu itheij caephengz, fuengzre gauj bienqdoeng、 miz gaeugemj. ",
        "Gozvuyen veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz gaengawq binghlah fwtfat、 banhlah cingzgvang caeuq baenz haih cingzdoh， ndaej gietdingh demlai、 gemjnoix bingh cungj roxnaeuz diuzcingj binghlah dwg ietloih roxnaeuz bingjloih， caemhcaiq goengbouh okdaeuj.",
        "Yihyoz yenyau wngdang yunghrengz hawj yifangz yihyoz gyauyuz caeuq gohyoz yenzgiu lai ak dem， aeu yifangz yihyoz mwnz goq neix bae gyauyuz caeuq beizyin gij hagseng ndaw hagdangz、 doengh boux guh gij hong caeuq fuengz yw binghlah mizgven de，hawj gij hong fuengz yw binghlah miz gisuz bae cengjdingx.",
        "Diuz cibbet Gak gaep gihgou fuengzre gaemhanh baenzbingh de youq mwh fuengzre gaemhanh binghlah hengzguh gij cizcwz lajneix：",
        "Deihfueng yinzminz cwngfuj caeuq aen gihgou fuengzre gaemhanh baenzbingh ciep ndaej gij yawhgingj binghlah Gozvuyen veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz roxnaeuz swngj、 swcigih、 cizyazsi yinzminz cwngfuj fat ok haenx le， wngdang ciuq aen yawh’anq fuengzre、 gaemhanh binghlah， hengzguh gij cosih doxwngq bae fuengzre、 gaemhanh binghlah.",
        "Doengh aen danhvei gunghawj raemxgwn de swnghcanj roxnaeuz gunghawj raemxgwn， wngdang ciuqfap aeu ndaej mbaw cingq veiswngh hijgojcwng.",
        "Gozvuyen veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz dinghgeiz goengbouh gij saenqsik yizcingz binghlah daengx guek. Swngj、 swcigih、 cizyazsi yinzminz cwngfuj veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz dinghgeiz goengbouh gij saenqsik yizcingz binghlah bonjdieg.",
        "Diuz seiqcib ngeih Mwh binghlah fwtfat、 banhlah，yienhgaep doxhwnj deihfueng yinzminz cwngfuj wngdang sikhaek diuhdoengh gak fuengmienh， ciuq aen yawh’anq yawhfuengz、 gaemhanh bae guh fuengz yw， gatduenh diuz roen cienzboq binghlah， danghnaeuz miz bizyau, bauq hawj caemhcaiq ginggvaq gaepgwnz yinzminz cwngfuj gietdingh， miz gienz hengzguh gij cosih gaenjgip lajneix caemhcaiq goengbouh okdaeuj：",
        "Diuz seiqcib gouj Mwh binghlah fwtfat、 banhlah， doengh aen danhvei swnghcanj、 gunghawj gijyw caeuq gaiqdawz ywbingh de wngdang gibseiz swnghcanj、 gunghawj gijyw caeuq gaiqdawz ywbingh fuengz yw binghlah. Doengh aen danhvei ginghyingz dietloh、 gyaudoeng、 minzyung hangzgungh de itdingh aeu soengq gij vunz cawqleix binghlah caeuq daeh gijyw、 gaiqdawz fuengz yw binghlah bae gonq. Yienhgaep doxhwnj yinzminz cwngfuj mizgven bouhmonz wngdang guh ndei gij hong cujciz hezdiuz.",
        "Diuz hajcib haj Yienhgaep doxhwnj yinzminz cwngfuj veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz youq mwh ciuq cizcwz bonjfaenh bae guh gamduk genjcaz， raen miz giz goekraemx vunzlai caez gwn yungh、 gijgwn caeuq gij doxgaiq doxgven deng goekbingh binghlah uqdawz， danghnaeuz mbouj gibseiz yungh cosih gaenjgip bae gaemhanh aiq yinxhwnj binghlah cienzboq、 banhlah， miz gienz hengzguh gij cosih laemzseiz bae fungsaek giz goekraemx vunzlai caez gwn yungh、 yocangz gijgwn caeuq gij doxgaiq mizgven roxnaeuz mboujcaengz guh gaicawx， caemhcaiq dawz de bae gienjniemh roxnaeuz siudoeg. Ginggvaq gienjniemh， dwg gijgwn deng uq de， wngdang coemh bae； gijgwn caengz deng uq roxnaeuz gij doxgaiq siudoeg gvaq lij ndaej yungh de， wngdang gejcawz gaemhanh.",
        "Diuz roekcib roek Yienhgaep doxhwnj yinzminz cwngfuj veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz famh gij gvidingh aen fap neix, miz gij yienghsaeh lajneix yiengh ndeu ne, youz doengzgaep yinzminz cwngfuj、 gaepgwnz yinzminz cwngfuj veiswngh hingzcwng bumwnz minghlingh gaijcingq, doengbauq baebingz; cauhdawz binghlah cienzboq、 banhlah roxnaeuz miz hougoj yiemzcungh wnq ne, doiq bouxcawjguenj rap miz cwzyin caeuq boux rap miz cwzyin cigsoh de, ciuqfap guh hingzcwng cawqfaen; danghnaeuz cauxbaenz famhcoih ne, ciuqfap cazdawz hingzsaeh cwzyin:",
        "(Haj) Mbouj ciuq gvidingh siudoeg gaiqdawz ywbingh, roxnaeuz gij gaiqdawz ywbingh ciuq gvidingh cij ndaej yungh baez ndeu cix yungh le mbouj vutbae coemhbae， youh dawzma caiq yungh;",
        "(Sam) Aen gihgou fuengzre gaemhanh baenzbingh、 aen gihgou ywbingh mbouj caephengz guekgya mizgven gvidingh, cauhbaenz aenvih dwk lwed haeuj ndang、 yungh yiengh doxgaiq aeu lwed daeuj cauhguh de cix deng dawz gij bingh ginggvaq lwed cienzboq haenx.",
        "(Sibsam) Siudoeg: Ceij yungh vayoz、 vuzlij、 swnghvuz bae gaj dai roxnaeuz siucawz gij bing’yenz veizswnghvuz hophenz bouxvunz raeuz.",
        "Vwnzva Dagwzming（文化大革命）, dwg gwnz lizsij Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz ciengz yindung cwngci daengx guek ndeu, fatseng youq 1966 nienz 5 nyied 16 hauh daengz 1976 nienz 10 nyied 6 hauh.",
        "Gaeulanghauh（Vahgun：土伏苓）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "Gvangjgimcienz（Vahgun：广东金钱草）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "Nomjsoemzsaeh（Vahgun：半枝莲）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "996 gunghcoz cidu（Sawgun：996工作制）, dwg aen cidu hong Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz mbangj di gunghswh（公司） saedhengz haenx. Gunghswh iugouz yenzgungh（员工） moix singhgiz hong 6 ngoenz, daj haet 9 diemj hong daengz gyanghaemh 9 diemj, couh dwg moix singhgiz 72 cungdaeuz.",
        "Maengzbaegmbouj（Vahgun：金不换）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "Go&#39;gyauz（Vahgun：粗糠柴）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "Hinggaeq（Vahgun：山柰）, dwg cungj Ywcuengh caeuq Doenghgo ndeu.",
        "Sunh Genz（Vahgun：孫權） (182 nienz 7 nyied 5 hauh－252 nienz 5 nyied 21 hauh), dwg aen DunghVuz vuengzdaeq youq Samguek seizgeiz ndeu.",
        "Byajmeb（Vahgun：閃電）, lij heuh byajmig, byajmyig, dwg meh yienhsiengq youq mbwnnamh ndeu. Fwj caeuq fwj mboujduenh doxdawz, miz ok dinghden(靜電). Dang denyaz dabdaengz moux aen cingzdoh, couh yaek miz Byajmyig .",
        "Miz haemh he， mbwn laepngaungau。 Ndaw singz miz boux swhgih mbouj saenq fangz he， de haici gvaq dieg moek vunzdai， dieg neix cungj dwg moek boux laeghoz、diuqdah dai，vunz naeuz dieg neix miz fangz。 Boux swhgih haenx haici gvaq dieg neix seiz， dingqnyi henz loh miz lwgnyez daej。 De roengz ci bae yawj， raen miz boux lwgnyez bi lai hung ndeu ninz youq henzloh。Boux swhgih umj lwgnyez haenx hwnj ci， cuengq de youq henz ndang couh haici ma ranz。 Hoeng gvaq cib lai faen cung le， lwgnyez haenx mbouj raen lo。 Boux swhgih neix ma ranz le， haemh haenx ninz couh lumj deng fangz hwnjndang nei luenh heuh， gvaq song ngoenz de couh dai youq gwnz mbonq lo……",
        "“Goengdauh Bouxyauzcuz neix ak lai lo，gijmaz fangz bungq daengz de cungj deuz daengz raem doek！” Yienghneix boux lwnh boux，vunz Mbanjgun",
        "nyezrauh raeuz cwxcaih couh guekgya cwxcaih, nyezrauh raeuz hwnjmbaek couh guekgya hwnjmbaek;",
        "Bohdaegcangh naeuz:“Yiengh- neix couh caih mwngz lo, ngaenz mbouj ndaej caiq ciq hawj mwngz lo, mwngz lingh siengj banhfap ba.”",
        "Bohdaegcangh ndaejnyi gij vah boux mbanj neix lo, de hix naemj daengz gienh saeh neix miz di youqgaenj: Daegyin 18 bi lo, baenz ra yah hawj de dahraix.",
        "Sien daeuj yawj yawj najmbanj diuz rijiq, diuz rijiq neix itbi seiqgeiq raemx sawdikdik. Duzbya、duzgungq ndaw rij cwxcaih dwk youz baez youz dauq, geijlai ndeigyaez! Baez daengz seizhah, gyoengq lwgnyez cungj gyaez daengz ndaw rijiq bae dajcaemx、gaeb duzbya, guhcaemz ndaej vaiqvued raixcaix.",
        "60 中华人民共和国保守国家秘密法实施条例 Aen Diuzlaeh Saedhengz Aen Fap Baujsouj Gij Mimiz Guekgya Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz",
        "113 中华人民共和国耕地占用税法 Aen Fap Gvaehsuiq Ciemqyungh Reihnaz Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz",
        "177 中华人民共和国老年人权益保障法 Aen Fap Baujcang Gij Gienzik Bouxlaux Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz",
        "230 中华人民共和国统计法实施条例 Aen Diuzlaeh Saedhengz Aen Fap Doengjgeiq Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz",
        "274 中华人民共和国治安管理处罚法 Aen Fap Cawqfad Gij Famh Cianh Guenjleix Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz",
        "Hoeng miz ngoenz ndeu, rong laemxsim riengz rumz bae youzlangh lo.",
        "Duz ndwen dap: 「Neix dwg rumzcin. De coiraeuz okbae, boemz youq gyangnamh haenx cungj aeu okbae.」",
        "Aenvih daengx lenzhozgoz guekgya dih yinzminz gaenq youq ndaw lenzhozgoz hencangh cungzsinh gyoengqde doiq gak cungj genzli,bijgangj gihbwnj yinzgenz,yinzgwz cinhnyenz,gyaciz, caeuq nanznij bingzdaengj,gyoengqde lij gietsim sevei miz cwyouz youh cinbu,ngoenz ndei gvaq ngoenz,",
        "1. (IT) Boux boux miz genz youq guekgya wnq ragiuz caeuq yiengjsou baujhu, yienghneix couh mbouj ndaej deng bwzhai.",
        "1. (IT) Boux boux miz genz yiengjsou vih veizciz de caeuq ranz de dih gyengangh caeuq fuzli sihyau dih saenghhoz sijcinj, baugvaz gijgwn, gijdaenj, ranzyouq, yihliuz, caeuq bizyau dih sevei fuzhu, danghnaeuz siznez, baenzbingh, canzfei, baenzmaiq, gyelaux roxnaeuz gij cingzgvang wnq vunz mbouj miz naengliz guhgwn, de miz genz yiengjsou baujcang.",
        "《Sozfaenz Gaijcih》（說文解字），dwg bonj saw ndeu, youq Cungguek Dunghhan seizgeiz youz yozcej Hij Senz sij saw, itgungh sou heauj ndaw fwngz 9353 cih saw. De hix dwg gij sawdenj ceiq caeux Cungguek seizneix.",
        "Vunz Rok, lij heuh Gihgiyinz（機器人） dwg aen rok ndeu, daegbied dwg gij rok ndaej youz dennauj biencwngz haenx, ndaej gag bae caephengz ithaehlied dungcoz fukcab.",
        "Muzlanz lij heuh Moeglanz（Vahgun: 花木蘭）, dwg gwnz lizsij Cungguek boux yinghyungz mehmbwk ndawbiengz ndeu.",
        "Gunghyez gwzming（Vahgun: 工業革命） dwg Ouhcouh caeuq Meijgoz yiengq saen cauhguh gunghyi gvaqdoh. De fatseng youq mwh daihgaiq 1760 nienz daengz daihgaiq 1840 nienz geizgan. Cungj cienjbienq neix baudaengz daj soujgungh swnghcanj fuengfap daengz gihgi swnghcanj；Vayoz Gunghyez moq cauhguh caeuq swnghcanj diet gunghyi；Sawjyungh rengzraemx caeuq cwnghgi doenghlig yied daeuj yied lai；Gihgi fazcanj caeuq gihgaiva gunghcangj hidungj hwnghwnj.",
        "Caz nding（Sawndip：茶𬻤、Sawgun：紅茶），dwg meh caz oemq nanz gvaq caz hau caeuq caz vuzlungz ndeu。",
        "Hongq Gahfeih，lij heuh Ranz Gahfeih、Bouq Gahfeih，dwg aen dieg hawj vunz gwn gahfeih ndeu。",
        "Gaunae（Sawndip：糕𮦈），lij heuh Sietgau（Sawgun：雪糕），dwg meh gijgwn van caeuq caep ndeu 。De aeu cijvai、geihremj、dangz daengj cwngzfwn cauhbaenz.",
        "Si Fuzsanh (Sawgun：佛山市)， Ciqyaem gaeuq: Baed San， dwg aen hawsingz youq baihnamz Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz，de hix dwg aen Si Deihgaep Swngj Gvangjdungh ndeu。Gijgvangj dwg 3797.72 bingzfueng goengleix。 2021 nienz haeujvunz miz 949.89 fanh。",
        "Yaenq（Sawndip：印），lij heuh hanj 、yaenqsaz 、dajyaenq，dwg dingz gisuz dawz yienzgauj mbawsiengq roxnaeuz saw，cix guhmoq vaiq raeuh ndeu。Itbuen yungh rokyaenqsaz dawz raemxmaeg yaenq youq gwnz ceij，dwg gij cwngzsi giekdaej okbanj。",
        "Yienh Duenzcangh（Sawgun：屯昌縣），dwg aen Hingzcwnggih yienhgaep youq baihnamz Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz，de hix dwg aen yienh Swngj Haijnanz ndeu。Gijgvangj dwg 1,223.97 bingzfueng goengleix。 Daengz 2020 nienz， haeujvunz miz 25.5 fanh。",
        "Google Hoiz，lij heuh Google Fanyig（Sawgun：Google翻譯）、Google Byuiq roxnaeuz Google Fanhoiz，dwg aen fuzvu hoiz youz Google youq bi 2006 codaeuz hawj ndeu，de mbouj dingh'aeu cienz，ndigah ndaej angqcoux raeuh。",
        "2007 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 2007，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz it codaeuz 。",
        "Seiqgyaiq doengzbingz（Sawndip：世界仝平，vahgun：平行世界） roxnaeuz Yijcou Lai（Sawndip：宇宙𫯓，vahgun：多重宇宙），dwg aen gyajsiet faedleixhag caengz cingqsaed ndeu。Aen gainiemh neix youz ciethaggyah caeuq simleixhaggyah Meijgoz Veihlenz Canhmujswh (William James) youq bi 1895 daezok。",
        "Cidu Dan’it roxnaeuz Caeqdoh Dan’it （Sawndip：制度單一），dwg dingz hingzsik gapbaenz guekgya ndeu。Cwngfuj cunghyangh miz cawjgienz cietdoiq doiq daengx aen diegguek caemhcaiq gyonjcomz gienzlig cwngci daengxmiz，aen guekgya neix miz haehdungj laebfap caeuq swhfap dungj’it haenx，caeuq cidu lienzbangh doxdoiq。Daengz seizneix，gij guekgya saedhengz cidu lienzbangh haenx miz gig lai，lumjbaenz Cungguek caeuq Yizbwnj。",
        "1989 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1989，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Ngoenzsinghgiz codaeuz 。",
        "1972 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1972，dwg aen bi'nyinh youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz roek codaeuz 。",
        "1956 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1956，dwg aen Bi'nyinh youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Ngoenzsinghgiz codaeuz 。",
        "1940 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1940，dwg aen bi'nyinh youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz it codaeuz 。",
        "1925 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1925，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz seiq codaeuz 。",
        "1909 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1909，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz haj codaeuz 。",
        "1893 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1893，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Ngoenzsinghgiz codaeuz 。",
        "1877 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1877，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz it codaeuz 。",
        "1861 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1861，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz ngeih codaeuz 。",
        "1845 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1845，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz sam codaeuz 。",
        "1829 nienz roxnaeuz Bi 1829，dwg aen bingznienz youq ligmoq ndeu，bi neix daj Singhgiz seiq codaeuz 。",
        "Boux hau（Sawndip：俌𭽑；Sawgun：白人），roxnaeuz Boux beg、Boux Bwz，dwg aen coh vunzcungj aeu gij saek naeng bouxvunz daeuj mingmingz ndeu，itbuen dwg ceij aen cungjcug miz saek naeng saw。Seizneix，haujlai boux hau faenbouh youq Baekmeijcouh、Dayangzcouh caeuq Ouhcouh。",
        "Cekgai（Sawndip：𪭪𰷔），lij heuh Gailengq；Gailing roxnaeuz Ceklingz，dwg aen duenhmbaek doeklaeng lienh gunghawj huq ndeu，youz canghgailing laeng bouxsiuhfei gai huq caeuq fugfouh。",
        "2024 nienz Cunghvaz Minzgoz cungjdungj sienjgij (Sawgun: 2024年中華民國總統選舉) dwg daihbet luenz Cunghvaz Minzgoz cungjdungj sienjgij, youq 2024 nienz 1 nyied 13 hauh.",
        "Alaska，dwg aen couh youq baihsaebaek Meijgoz ndeu。Gijgvangj dwg 1,717,856 bingzfueng goengleix。 Daengz bi 2020，haeujvunz miz 71 fanh。",
        "Jimmy Carter (ngoenz 1 ndwen 10 bi 1924) dwg boux vunz Meijgoz ndeu, hix dwg daih samcibgouj nyaemh cungjdungj Meijgoz.",
        "Louisiana，dwg aen couh youq baihnamz Meijgoz ndeu。Gijgvangj dwg 52,124 bingzfueng goengleix。 Daengz bi 2023，haeujvunz miz 466 fanh。",
        "Ohio，dwg aen couh youq baihdoengbaek Meijgoz ndeu。Gijgvangj dwg 44,825 bingzfueng goengleix。 Daengz bi 2023，haeujvunz miz 1178 fanh。",
        "Canz Sej (Sawgun:残雪, 1953 nienz 5 nyied 30 hauh), Cunghgoz cozgya. Gij sawcuenh de sij miz: 《Vangznizgaih》 (1985)、《Vujyanggaih》(2002)、《Bouxcingz ceiq haemh》(2005) dengj dengj.",
        "Haj Yaz (Sawgun:海漄) dwg boux canghsawcuenh Cunghvaz Yinzminz Gunghozgoz. 1990 nienz seng youq Yanghdanz, seizneix ranz youq Sinhcin. Bien sawcuenh gohvan de 《Cangveh Seizhoengq》, sij gij saeh Vangz Hihmung, youq 2023 nienz ndaej Yijgojciengj.",
        "Bahyennauwj dwg aen si deihgaet, youq baihsae Neimungzguj Swcigih, baihbaek caeuq Mungzguj doxciep. De guenj aen gih ndaeu (Linzhoz Gih, diegyouq Si Yinzminz Cwngfuj), 2 aen yen caeuq 3 aen geiz. Daengx si najdieg miz 6.5 fanh bingzfueng goengleix, gyaeujvunz ciengzseiz youq 150.34 fanh vunz (2023 nienz), miz Mungzguj、Gun、Veiz、Manj、Dazvuwj daengj minzcuz."
    ]
}
